    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "SSC Frequent Trap: Phrases like 'along with', 'as well as', and 'together with' placed between subject and verb do not alter the subject's number.",
        "In 'One of the + Plural Noun + Relative Pronoun (who/which/that)', the verb following the relative pronoun must be PLURAL.",
        "Expressions of distance, time, money, and measurement take a singular verb when considered as a single unified amount."
      ],
      "id": "tnupfp2"
